  "title": "UZ801: Images of working devices",
  "body": "Since there is a variety of \"UZ801\" type LTE sticks, and we don't know how to spot a working one, let's start a thread where everybody posts their device that worked with uz801. Maybe this way people can make a more educated guess as to whether a specific aliexpress listing will work.\r\n\r\n<details><summary> **outside** </summary>\r\n\r\n<img width=\"3072\" height=\"4096\" alt=\"IMG_20260426_191924\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9850c001-657f-44e5-b433-2ab2db0c5969\" />\r\n<img width=\"4096\" height=\"3072\" alt=\"IMG_20260426_192006\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0ea5d638-a82d-4d97-964f-656aa62de528\" />\r\n<img width=\"4096\" height=\"3072\" alt=\"IMG_20260426_191933\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5cbfe180-e00b-4031-afc7-357f79f66843\" />\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n<details><summary> **teardown** </summary>\r\n\r\n<img width=\"4096\" height=\"3072\" alt=\"IMG_20260426_192054\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/aa819876-3ec6-40a1-b713-1f405a9ef7c2\" />\r\n<img width=\"3072\" height=\"4096\" alt=\"IMG_20260426_192227\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6a9caefb-f2ce-417c-9225-16f9a5dc4d8f\" />\r\n<img width=\"4096\" height=\"3072\" alt=\"IMG_20260426_192106\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/02c97810-aa09-4560-a07f-c2096068ea43\" />\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n\r\nNote that aliexpress listings come and go, so collecting links seems pointless.",
